    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file that extracts key-value pairs from a form-like document using an external provider, I need to choose a concrete external service that offers document processing capabilities. Amazon Textract is a suitable choice for this task as it provides a service to extract text and data from scanned documents. I will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to integrate with Amazon Textract. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863244397,
          "start": 1789863241662
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc29a7be001T4PKyMOf1JiJBn",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc2974a0001UlOWx26Li8pyt2",
      "session_id": "ses_f43d68b6fffeyS7bsQE7Ze4Zb0",
