    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file that extracts table cells and row structure from a document using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Textract service. This service is identifiable by the 'boto3' library import, which is specific to AWS services, and the use of the 'textract' client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863226608,
          "start": 1789863224190
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc29637e001MXLWtduy4NRCLT",
